  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add curry powder and garam masala and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add lentils and 2 cups of water, bring to a boil, then reduce heat and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Let it cool, then refrigerate for at least 2 hours to allow fermentation.",
    "Reheat and serve hot."
